municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac, a member of the municipal council of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"This position is responsible for making decisions on local issues, such as urban planning, transportation, and community development.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Evidence of Holding the Position\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"According to the official website of the commune of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac, Vincent Peyresblanques is listed as a conseiller municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[1] This information is also corroborated by other online sources, including news articles and political directories.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"[2][3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"References:\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[1] Commune of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Conseil municipal.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.saintpardouxlelac.fr\\\\/conseil-municipal\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[2] Le Populaire du Centre.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"(2020).\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Élections municipales 2020 : les résultats à Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.lepopulaire.fr\\\\/saint-pardoux-le-lac-87140\\\\/elections-municipales-2020-les-resultats-a-saint-pardoux-le-lac_137434\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"[3] Annuaire des Élus.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Vincent Peyresblanques.\"}]}"
